# Step 2: Non-linear transformation - Log of SdO (Sum of dO E-states)
# Feature: log_SdO
# Feature description: Applies logarithmic transformation to SdO to capture the diminishing effect of high values while highlighting subtle differences in smaller ranges.
# Usefulness: High values of SdO might have disproportionate influence on biodegradability, so capturing the non-linear behavior of this feature can help the model better learn important patterns.

df['log_SdO'] = df['SdO'].apply(lambda x: np.log(x + 1))  # Adding 1 to handle zero values safely.
end

python
# Step 3: Ratio Feature - nCp / C%
