# Usefulness: High values of SdO might have disproportionate influence on biodegradability, so capturing the non-linear behavior of this feature can help the model better learn important patterns.

df['log_SdO'] = df['SdO'].apply(lambda x: np.log(x + 1))  # Adding 1 to handle zero values safely.
